{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1527477-titans-ba-al-hammon","id":1527477,"title":"Titans: Ba'al Hammon","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-12-26T19:26:24-08:00","id":1527477,"title":"Titans: Ba'al Hammon","content":"I'm a little curious as to why they assert that infant sacrifices to Ba'al Hammon were an indisputable historical fact when the sources I've seen on recent research suggests that it's just as plausible that the offerings were of children who had already died - infant mortality being what it is, this is entirely within the realm of possibility.<br /> <br /> The &quot;Press X to Doubt&quot; line was a little cringe. This is an RPG book, not a Twitter post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-27T15:38:26-08:00","id":1527521,"title":"","content":"Well the 'Why' is covered directly in the pre-release text<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Dead Infants vs. Your Fun Table<br /> Yes, this entry references historical fact: after scholarly pushback in the latter half of the<br /> twentieth century against the idea that Phoenicians ever partook in human sacrifice, digs<br /> in historical Phoenician settlements uncovered what is now considered irrefutable evidence<br /> of the practice. Dr Josephine Quinn of Oxford University\u2019s Faculty of Classics wrote<br /> extensively on the topic. Before this evidence came to light, scholars widely considered the<br /> historical accounts of child sacrifice to be Greek or Roman propaganda. Turns out, it\u2019s just<br /> true.<br /> We include Ba\u2019al Hammon with this scholarly information in mind because pretending it<br /> never happened means whitewashing history for our own sensibilities. However, this in no<br /> way obliges any table to include this aspect of the historical Phoenician worship of Ba\u2019al,<br /> and Storyguides should handle this potential aspect of the Ilhm mindfully. We have<br /> carefully drawn a clear line dividing the ancient culture which spawned the Ilhm from<br /> modern Judaism, but that doesn\u2019t mean that in a real world of rising antisemitism,<br /> especially rising repetition of blood libel in real-life governments, that players will want to<br /> engage with this.<br /> And that\u2019s okay. </div> </div> </div>I guess its just a difference of sources, Dr Josephine Quinn seems to be the primary for Titan Rising.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Find my Homebrew so far here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18X_mkFwDcM0sSN9R2GoQ72Q5FqW1deFgEM3HIGneABQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> So far its Demon Merits, Vampire 1e to 2e ports and a Knowledge collection mechanic for the Ordo Dracul!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24597-lordofiron","name":"LordofIron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24597_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-28T13:39:57-08:00","id":1527575,"title":"","content":"If I ran a Scion game featuring Ba\u2019al Hammon, I would probably not include the infant sacrifice angle. Just too graphic for my tastes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}